# Ultimate Debloat Pack (UDP) - short start command:
#
#   irm https://hamiddidnoteat.github.io/udp | iex
#
# This one line loads the bootstrap script from the official repository. That script downloads the
# latest release, checks it against the SHA256SUMS file published with it, and starts UDP.
# Bootstrap source: https://github.com/HamidDidNotEat/Ultimate-Debloat-Pack/blob/main/Get.ps1
irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HamidDidNotEat/Ultimate-Debloat-Pack/main/Get.ps1 | iex
